# 52. Important Mental Model

Students should remember:

```text
              AGGREGATION
                   │
        ┌──────────┼──────────┐
        │          │          │
      COUNT       SUM        AVG
        │          │          │
      Count       Total     Average
       
        ┌──────────┴──────────┐
        │                     │
       MIN                   MAX
        │                     │
     Smallest               Largest
```

And:

```text
Many rows
    ↓
Aggregate function
    ↓
Summary result
```

