That takes us to:

# 09 — GROUP BY & HAVING

We will learn:

```sql
GROUP BY
HAVING
```

and queries such as:

```sql
SELECT
    department,
    COUNT(*) AS employee_count,
    AVG(salary) AS average_salary
FROM employees
GROUP BY department;
```

Then:

```sql
HAVING AVG(salary) > 50000;
```

This is the point where students start moving from **basic SQL querying** into **real data analysis and reporting**.
